  "name": "Breath of Thunder: Swarm",
  "type": "jutsu",
  "img": "icons/svg/book.svg",
  "system": {
    "identifier": "breath-of-thunder-swarm",
    "description": "<p>You begin to collect lightning release chakra until it sparks off of your weapon and body with violent jolts. You surround the enemy with waves of arched lightning swift strikes and attack them from all directions.</p>\n<p>Make two melee taijutsu attacks using your weapon, dealing your [Weapons damage] + 1d8 lightning damage. If the target has the Shocked condition, you make your attacks with a +1 bonus to critical threat range.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Affected creature must make a Dexterity saving throw, being disarmed on a failed save and their weapon thrown 10 feet in any direction of your choice.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: Affected creature must make a Dexterity saving throw, gaining a rank of Bleed on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage dealt by 1d8. If this jutsu is cast at A-Rank or higher, if the target has the Shocked condition, you make your attacks with advantage.</p>",
